## Twink Engine

Quick Start:
    - 1. git clone https://github.com/erqeon/twink
    - 2. cd twink
    - 3. cargo run

## Map:
    CONTRIBUTING - For your reference regarding the email dispatch.
    COPYING - You generally won't need it for development, since you won't be interacting with it—though if you're curious about the license, it might come in handy (who actually reads this stuff?).
    CREDITS - Here are listed all those who submitted the patch.
    TASKS - If you are a beginner or want to solve a problem, this file will help you.